:R-HSA-428540  a            owl:NamedIndividual , obo:GO_0016601 ;
        rdfs:comment        "A low level of RAC1 activity is essential to maintain axon outgrowth. ROBO activation recruits SOS, a dual specificity GEF, to the plasma membrane via Dock homolog NCK (NCK1 or NCK2) to activate RAC1 during midline repulsion." ;
        rdfs:label          "Activation of RAC1" ;
        dc:contributor      "Authored: Garapati, P V, 2008-09-05 06:02:05" , "Edited: Orlic-Milacic, Marija, 2017-06-26" , "Edited: Garapati, P V, 2008-09-05 06:02:05" , "GOC:reactome_curators" , "Reviewed: Kidd, T, 2009-08-18" , "Reviewed: Jaworski, Alexander, 2017-07-31" ;
        dc:date             "2023-06-21" ;
        pav:providedBy      "https://reactome.org" ;
